# Mission Control × Figma design system

Use this when implementing or adapting Figma (MCP `get_design_context`, Code Connect, screenshots).
Figma-generated code is a **visual reference**, not paste-ready production code. Adapt to this stack.

## 1. Token definitions

| Source | Path |
| --- | --- |
| Runtime tokens | [`src/index.css`](src/index.css) — CSS custom properties on `:root` / theme |
| Brand authority | [`docs/knowledge/brand-system.md`](docs/knowledge/brand-system.md) |
| Style guide PDF | `assets/brand/` (internal; do not export guide text) |

**Format:** plain CSS variables (`--aaa-blue`, `--aaa-ink`, …). No Style Dictionary / token JSON pipeline.

**Digital palette only** (never print red `#ED1C2F`):

- Primary blue: `--aaa-blue` `#05539F` (Figma sometimes shows `#00529C` — prefer implemented tokens)
- Digital red (submit/errors only): `--aaa-red` `#E31E2E`
- Ink / muted / border / surfaces: see brand-system.md
- Red and bronze are never primary CTAs; red is final submit / genuine errors

**Typography:** Open Sans only (`@fontsource/open-sans`). Never Gotham, Nunito, Oswald, Roboto, or Google Fonts CDN.

**Contrast:** compute with `.cursor/skills/verify-live-ux/scripts/contrast.py`; never assert ratios from the PDF alone.

## 2. Component library

| Location | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `src/components/` | Shared UI (Header, queue, dashboard, dialogs, forms) |
| `src/views/` | Route-level screens |
| `src/components/dashboard/` | Home tool cards (`ToolCard`, `ToolIcon`, `AddToolsDialog`) |
| `src/components/queue/` | Request Queue + Executive |

No Storybook. Patterns: React function components, project `aaa-*` classes, DaisyUI only where already used.

**Reuse before inventing:** Header lockup, `ToolCard`, form field classes (`.aaa-field`, `.aaa-btn-*`), dialogs.

## 3. Frameworks and libraries

- **UI:** React 19 + React Router 7
- **Build:** Vite 6 (`npm run dev` / `npm run build` → `dist/`)
- **CSS:** Tailwind CSS 4 (`@tailwindcss/vite`) + DaisyUI 5 + global `src/index.css`
- **Fonts:** `@fontsource/open-sans` (self-hosted)
- **Base path:** `APP_BASE_PATH` / `import.meta.env.BASE_URL` — never hard-code absolute asset roots

## 4. Asset management

| Kind | Where |
| --- | --- |
| In-app images (logo) | `src/assets/` imported by Vite |
| Brand masters | `assets/brand/` |
| UI mocks / Figma refs | `assets/mocks/` |
| Exports / screenshots | `assets/exports/` (gitignored content; PII risk) |

No third-party image/font CDN at runtime (CSP + privacy). Vite fingerprints `/assets/*` in production.

**Logo:** use `aaa-life-logo-2color.png` as shipped. Never stretch, recolor, crop, rotate, or rebuild from parts. Prefer `object-fit: contain`.

## 5. Icon system

- Dashboard glyphs: [`src/components/dashboard/ToolIcon.tsx`](src/components/dashboard/ToolIcon.tsx) and related SVG/assets
- No icon-font CDN; no emoji as primary UI affordances on branded surfaces
- Figma MCP asset URLs are temporary — download into `src/assets/` or reuse an existing ToolIcon; never leave `figma.com/api/mcp/asset/...` in shipped code

## 6. Styling approach

- **Global brand CSS** in `src/index.css` (`.aaa-header`, `.aaa-queue-*`, `.aaa-exec-*`, forms)
- **Tailwind utilities** for layout/spacing (`flex`, `gap-*`, breakpoints `sm:` / `lg:`)
- **Responsive:** mobile-first; Concept v1 mobile home header is node `600:1084` / Header Mobile `600:1123` (logo + divider + title visible)
- Prefer existing `aaa-*` classes over one-off absolute-position Figma dumps
- Underline only links; links bold in blue or red

### Home mobile list-card (Figma `600:1084`)

| Breakpoint | Pattern |
| --- | --- |
| `max-width: 639px` | `.aaa-tool-grid` is a single column (`max-width: 20rem`). Cards are **row** layout: 56×56 icon (`border-radius: 1rem`) + `.aaa-tool-copy` (label + desc). Card height ~`5.25rem` / 84px. Emphasized intake keeps 2px `--aaa-blue` border. |
| `min-width: 640px` (`sm+`) | Portrait tiles **15×10.5rem**, centered flex wrap (Concept v1 `369-4361`). |

Do **not**: paste Figma Helvetica; leave temporary `figma.com/api/mcp/asset` URLs in code; ship the search/mic pill without a real search path; rename shipped tiles to Figma’s “New Request” / “Sales Tools” without a product decision.

## 7. Project structure

```
src/components/   UI building blocks
src/views/        routes
src/lib/          adapters (workfront, meetings, storage, intake)
api/workfront/    Vercel serverless (hosted Workfront proxy)
workfront-proxy/  local + Adobe Runtime actions
deep-dive-proxy/  local Graph/Excel stand-in
docs/             INDEX, decisions, brand, deployment
.cursor/rules/    company + project guardrails
```

External systems enter as **typed adapters** with a local implementation first. Secrets never in `VITE_*`.

## Figma MCP workflow reminders

1. Load `figma-design-to-code` before `get_design_context`; request a screenshot.
2. Map nodes to existing components/tokens before writing markup.
3. Copy corrections: Mission (not Misson); queue (not que); **Workfront**, **Monday.com**, **AAA Life Insurance Company**.
4. WCAG 2.2 AA is the floor; never convey state by color alone.
5. Cross-team listings stay summary-only (no brief body / requester email on match cards).
